        "intro": "Cramping during pregnancy is common, but it is understandable to worry when you feel pain. Mild, short-lived cramps often have an everyday explanation, while severe, persistent or associated symptoms need assessment. The pattern, location, pregnancy stage and other symptoms all matter.",
