        "intro": "Pregnancy can change your skin, and it can also change which products belong in your routine. You do not need an elaborate regimen: a gentle cleanser, a suitable moisturiser and daily sun protection are a strong foundation. The important step is checking active ingredients and reviewing prescription or medicated products with your obstetric clinician or dermatologist.",
